LangString appRunning ${LANG_ENGLISH} "reel is open. Quit it from its tray icon, then try again."
LangString appRunningOkKill ${LANG_ENGLISH} "reel is open.$\nOK ends it."
LangString failedToKillApp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "reel could not be ended. Quit it from its tray icon, then try again."
LangString createDesktop ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Add a shortcut to the desktop"
LangString deleteAppData ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Also remove reel's settings, logs and pairing"
LangString silentDowngrades ${LANG_ENGLISH} "A newer reel is installed; a silent install does not replace it with an older one.$\n"
LangString installingWebview2 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing WebView2, which reel's window needs..."
LangString webview2AbortError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 could not be installed, and reel's window needs it. Run the installer again."
LangString webview2DownloadError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 could not be downloaded: $0"
LangString webview2DownloadSuccess ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 downloaded"
LangString webview2Downloading ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Downloading WebView2..."
LangString webview2InstallError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2's installer ended with $1"
LangString webview2InstallSuccess ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 installed"
